{"verse_key": "10:66", "surah": 10, "verse": 66, "text_uthmani": "أَلَآ إِنَّ لِلَّهِ مَن فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَن فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ وَمَا يَتَّبِعُ ٱلَّذِينَ يَدْعُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ شُرَكَآءَ ۚ إِن يَتَّبِعُونَ إِلَّا ٱلظَّنَّ وَإِنْ هُمْ إِلَّا يَخْرُصُونَ", "translation": "Unquestionably, to Allāh belongs whoever is in the heavens and whoever is on the earth. And those who invoke other than Allāh do not [actually] follow [His] \"partners.\" They follow not except assumption, and they are not but misjudging.", "verse_from_ms": 1477810, "verse_to_ms": 1508190, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "أَلَآ", "start_ms": 1477810, "end_ms": 1481360}, {"i": 1, "text": "إِنَّ", "start_ms": 1481360, "end_ms": 1482470}, {"i": 2, "text": "لِلَّهِ", "start_ms": 1482470, "end_ms": 1483520}, {"i": 3, "text": "مَن", "start_ms": 1483520, "end_ms": 1484290}, {"i": 4, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 1484290, "end_ms": 1484520}, {"i": 5, "text": "ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ", "start_ms": 1484520, "end_ms": 1485960}, {"i": 6, "text": "وَمَن", "start_ms": 1485960, "end_ms": 1486950}, {"i": 7, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 1486950, "end_ms": 1487190}, {"i": 8, "text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "start_ms": 1487190, "end_ms": 1488910}, {"i": 9, "text": "ۗ", "start_ms": 1488910, "end_ms": 1489600}, {"i": 10, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 1489600, "end_ms": 1490520}, {"i": 11, "text": "يَتَّبِعُ", "start_ms": 1490520, "end_ms": 1491550}, {"i": 12, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 1491550, "end_ms": 1492550}, {"i": 13, "text": "يَدْعُونَ", "start_ms": 1492550, "end_ms": 1493280}, {"i": 14, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 1493280, "end_ms": 1493950}, {"i": 15, "text": "دُونِ", "start_ms": 1493950, "end_ms": 1494650}, {"i": 16, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 1494650, "end_ms": 1497490}, {"i": 17, "text": "شُرَكَآءَ", "start_ms": 1497490, "end_ms": 1499010}, {"i": 18, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 1499010, "end_ms": 1500310}, {"i": 19, "text": "إِن", "start